                                                "sense_id": "20a8343f-020f-33e5-8061-832923fb1721",
                                                "text": "[Round] 9. This was a scientific round on both sides; Acton got away well; and also parried some tremendous blows. The latter, however, received a chancery nobber; but he contended every inch of ground till he went down."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d712e397-23a1-4b22-8ab6-e9197d5eea91",
